{"speciesId":31,"names":{"fr":"Nidoqueen","es":"Nidoqueen","en":"Nidoqueen","ja":"ニドクイン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Its hard scales provide strong protection. It uses its hefty bulk to execute powerful moves."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Its hard scales provide strong protection. It uses its hefty bulk to execute powerful moves."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Tough scales cover the sturdy body of this POKéMON. It appears that the scales grow in cycles."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its body is cover­ ed with needle- like scales. It never shows signs of shrinking from any attack."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It uses its scaly, rugged body to seal the entrance of its nest and protect its young from predators."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The hard scales that cover its strong body serve as excellent protection from any attack."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NIDOQUEEN’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"NIDOQUEEN’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles using its tough, scaly body. This POKéMON is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The body is covered by stiff, needle- like scales. If it becomes excited, the needles bristle outwards."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Its hard scales provide strong protection. It uses its hefty bulk to execute powerful moves."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its body is covered with needle-like scales. It never shows signs of shrinking from any attack."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It uses its scaly, rugged body to seal the entrance of its nest and protect its young from predators."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’écailles solides. Il donnera sa vie pour secourir les petits de son terrier."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’écailles solides. Il donnera sa vie pour secourir les petits de son terrier."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its entire body is armored with hard scales. It will protect the young in its burrow with its life."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il se sert de son corps lourdement protégé pour empêcher les prédateurs d’accéder à son nid."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Usa su cuerpo duro y escamoso para sellar la entrada a su madriguera y protegerse de los depredadores."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It uses its scaly, rugged body to seal the entrance of its nest and protect its young from predators."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"ウロコで 覆われた 頑丈な 体で 巣穴の 入り口を ふさぎ 敵から 子供たちを 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est recouvert d’écailles en forme de pointes. Quand ce Pokémon s’énerve, ses pointes se dressent de façon menaçante."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Tiene el cuerpo recubierto de escamas duras y cortantes. Cuando se inquieta, las usa para defenderse."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The body is covered by stiff, needlelike scales. If it becomes excited, the needles bristle outwards."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"硬くて 針のような ウロコが 体を 覆っている。 興奮すると 針が 逆立つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Nidoqueen est protégé par des écailles extrêmement dures. Il aime envoyer ses ennemis voler en leur fonçant dessus. Ce Pokémon utilise toute sa puissance lorsqu’il protège ses petits."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nidoqueen tiene el cuerpo totalmente recubierto de escamas durísimas. Suele lanzar por los aires a sus rivales de los violentos golpes que les propina. Cuando se trata de defender a sus crías, alcanza su nivel máximo de fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nidoqueen’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This Pokémon is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"硬い ウロコで 覆われた 体を ぶつけて 相手を 弾き飛ばす 攻撃が 得意だ。 子どもを 守る ときが 一番 強い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps de Nidoqueen est protégé par des écailles extrêmement dures. Il aime envoyer ses ennemis voler en leur fonçant dessus. Ce Pokémon utilise toute sa puissance lorsqu’il protège ses petits."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nidoqueen tiene el cuerpo totalmente recubierto de escamas durísimas. Suele lanzar por los aires a sus rivales de los violentos golpes que les propina. Cuando se trata de defender a sus crías, alcanza su nivel máximo de fuerza."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nidoqueen’s body is encased in extremely hard scales. It is adept at sending foes flying with harsh tackles. This Pokémon is at its strongest when it is defending its young."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"硬い ウロコで 覆われた 体を ぶつけて 相手を 弾き飛ばす 攻撃が 得意だ。 子どもを 守る ときが 一番 強い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Son corps musclé est recouvert de dures écailles. On dit qu’elles peuvent repousser."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Su robusto cuerpo está recubierto de escamas durísimas que se renuevan constantemente."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Tough scales cover the sturdy body of this Pokémon. It appears that the scales grow in cycles."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"硬い ウロコに 覆われた 頑丈な 体の 持ち主。 ウロコは 生え変わるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Son corps musclé est recouvert de dures écailles. On dit qu’elles peuvent repousser."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Su robusto cuerpo está recubierto de escamas durísimas que se renuevan constantemente."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Tough scales cover the sturdy body of this Pokémon. It appears that the scales grow in cycles."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"硬い ウロコに 覆われた 頑丈な 体の 持ち主。 ウロコは 生え変わるらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est plus doué pour se défendre que pour attaquer. Grâce à son blindage d’écailles, il protège ses petits de toute agression."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su defensa destaca sobre la capacidad ofensiva. Usa las escamas del cuerpo como una coraza para proteger a su prole de cualquier ataque."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Nidoqueen is better at defense than offense. With scales like armor, this Pokémon will shield its children from any kind of attack."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"攻めるよりも 守るほうが 得意。 鎧のような ウロコで いかなる 攻撃からも 子どもを 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ce Pokémon calme les p